  "description": "One API over the FFmpegKit bindings for Android and iOS: run FFmpeg/FFprobe commands with awaitable calls, typed media information and progress reporting, instead of writing a per-platform adapter over Ffmpegkit.Droid and Ffmpegkit.Ios by hand. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. For .NET MAUI apps, FFmpegKit.Net.Maui adds the app-builder wiring.",
